{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个人渐渐发现自己非常喜欢另一个人，贪恋两人相处时的亲近和温柔，却总怕暴露自己的需要、显得太黏，甚至担心说出心意会失去眼前的美好。经历反复犹豫、不安和短暂退缩后，他逐渐接受自己的感情，终于愿意把藏着的话说出来，也发现对方并没有因此离开。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"想亲近又怕暴露\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"对方没有退开\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"享受当下却欲言又止\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01/S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"想说出口留住美好\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"怕显得太黏人\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01/S04\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"被看穿后退回内心\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01/S05\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"回想陪伴而欣喜\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02/S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"坦露心意后轻松\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05/S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"不安袭来又被安抚\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01/S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"紧绷渐松仍有心事\",\n      \"echo\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"承认喜欢并愿陪伴\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02/S10\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"想倾尽所有却怕无常\",\n      \"echo\": \"S04/S11\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"幸福过后更怕失去\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01/S04/S12\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"caught\": \"终于说完并得到回应\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01/S13\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是 S06 和 S11：S06 从被看见心意突然转向孤独和自我退缩，S11 的念头指向不够明确，稍微难以跟上。最抓人的是 S01—S05 反复想靠近又不敢表达的拉扯，以及 S13—S14 从害怕失去到终于说出口的收束，前后呼应很明显。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "177041d3-8790-484d-a077-1473776eaacd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T184915033317Z", "elapsed_seconds": 41.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T18:49:56.457195+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "95f9fef391a15a321c1e238fc86c63e9d029f83651003a7b941534aab126e22c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T184915033317Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "2d5a4589508ac6711b6767ae6efd76ad50d663f2e0e1b2034a3